|'for'
|-
|modre
|'among'
|-
|dhəbiˀtʃ
|'till, until, up to'
|-
|bhitrirɛ
|'inside, within'
|-
|talarɛ
|'middle'
|-
|latarrɛ
|'under'
|-
|lagire
|'due to'
|-
|tʃetanrɛ
|'above, top'
|-
|leka/leka-tɛ
|'like/by any means'
|-
|atɛ
|'along with'
|-
|hɔtɛˀtʃtɛ
|'for, by, due to'
|-
|tuluˀtʃ
|'being with, association with'
|-
|iəte
|'owing to, due to, on account of'
|-
| ''-katɛ''
|gerund, converb
